    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Databases & SAP \u2014 what each integration actually collects\n\n**Oracle / SQL Server / Postgres / MySQL \u2192 Database Monitoring** (query metrics, explain plans, the 'SELECT *' story). **SAP HANA \u2192 Redpeaks** (memory / CPU / connections / blocked transactions / availability \u2014 *not* query-level SQL; HANA isn't a DBM engine and the collector doesn't expose expensive SQL). **SAP S/4HANA \u2192 Redpeaks / Agentil NetWeaver** (work processes, ABAP response, dumps, IDOC/RFC). **SAP Cloud ALM \u2192 RapDev** (CPI/integration message monitoring, exceptions, jobs). **SAP Integration Suite \u2192 logs** via API.",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
